MoGe-2 ViT-S (normal) -- metric depth model, remote-header listing
====================================================================

This package redistributes NO model weights. It is a manifest that points a host at the
original author-published ONNX export, pinned to an exact Hugging Face commit and a SHA-256
digest. The LICENSE file next to this one is the upstream microsoft/MoGe LICENSE, verbatim
(commit 74fbce054ebed49800de42d0ad0e83495065719a): MIT for the MoGe work, Apache-2.0 for the
DINOv2 code and backbone.

