What this notice does not establish
  * The authors state the licence of the weights; they do not publish an audit of the
    licences of the 24 datasets MoGe-2 was trained on (paper section 4 and appendix A.2; they
    include driving and indoor-scan datasets such as Waymo Open, Argoverse 2 and ScanNet++
    whose own terms are, to our knowledge, non-commercial or research-only -- not verified
    here). azphalt has not audited them either. If that matters for your use, take it up
    with the authors.
  * Hosting is by Hugging Face under the author's account. If the file is moved, edited or
    removed upstream, the checksum in the manifest makes a host reject it rather than run it.

